%% Searching in the server list (apps/web/src/pages/ServerList.tsx, lib/useLatestRequest.ts).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff
  participant UI as Server list
  participant URL as URL query string
  participant Hook as useLatestRequest
  participant API

  Staff->>UI: types "w"
  UI->>URL: after 300 ms, replace with ?q=w
  URL->>Hook: key changed, request 1
  Hook->>API: GET /api/servers?q=w (slow)
  Staff->>UI: types "e"
  UI->>URL: replace with ?q=we
  URL->>Hook: key changed, abort 1, request 2
  Hook->>API: GET /api/servers?q=we
  API-->>Hook: answer 2
  Hook->>UI: 2 is the newest, show it
  API-->>Hook: answer 1 arrives late (the server ignored the abort)
  Hook--xUI: 1 is not the newest, dropped
  alt the request fails
    Hook->>UI: error state with Retry, never an empty list
  end
  Note over URL: a reload or a shared link reads the state back from the URL. Unknown values are dropped before calling the API, which rejects unknown parameters
